{"title":"Dune Alpha","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 28 Desert Wolf that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 2 times (1.8% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      <p class=\"s\">Special: packDamagePerAlly: .15</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/wolf-sinew\">Wolf Sinew</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-alpha\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-alpha?lv=27\">Lv 27 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-alpha?lv=28\">Lv 28 <span>87</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/dune-alpha?lv=29\">Lv 29 <span>63</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-alpha?lv=27\" title=\"Pick level 27\"><td><b>27</b></td><td>100</td><td>19.4</td><td>1,350</td><td class=\"muted\">300 · 27.2 · 4,050</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Thak%20Scout%20Camp\">Thak Scout Camp</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-alpha?lv=28\" title=\"Pick level 28\"><td><b>28</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>106</td><td>19.9</td><td>1,400</td><td class=\"muted\">318 · 27.9 · 4,200</td><td>87</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Alpha's%20Rock\">Alpha&#39;s Rock</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-alpha\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>29</b></td><td>111</td><td>20.5</td><td>1,450</td><td class=\"muted\">333 · 28.7 · 4,350</td><td>63</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Alpha's%20Rock\">Alpha&#39;s Rock</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"dune-alpha\" data-map-level=\"29\">Show level 29 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 4 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 2 recorded drops, 215 total, 103–112 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×103–112</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"sunbleached-fang\" title=\"Sunbleached Fang - in 3 of 4 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 4 total, 2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/87ff80ab6feed9f385f8.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sunbleached Fang</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.3<br>×2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"jackal-pelt\" title=\"Jackal Pelt - in 2 of 4 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 3 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a527c3adeb957a426463.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Jackal Pelt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1–2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dune-alpha-hide\" title=\"Dune Alpha Hide - in 3 of 4 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/06d4d7f57b1ebe34de06.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Alpha Hide</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.3<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+2 more\">+2 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"wolf-meat\" title=\"Wolf Meat - in 3 of 4 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/3754737ea3fb2fec593a.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wolf Meat</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.3<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bearhide-legs\" title=\"Bearhide Legs - in 1 of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/d5f0c0f64a5f6fd492e9.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bearhide Legs</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Inferior: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>⭐ Elite loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"sunbleached-fang\" title=\"Sunbleached Fang - in 3 of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 3 total, 3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/87ff80ab6feed9f385f8.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sunbleached Fang</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.3<br>×3</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"bodkin-bolt\" title=\"Bodkin Bolt - in 1 of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 3 total, 3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7a2e1626588f08ce161d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bodkin Bolt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×3</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"dune-alpha-hide\" title=\"Dune Alpha Hide - in 3 of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/06d4d7f57b1ebe34de06.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Alpha Hide</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.3<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"wolf-meat\" title=\"Wolf Meat - in 3 of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/3754737ea3fb2fec593a.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wolf Meat</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.3<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-414.4px,-477.6px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/0/1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/0/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/1/1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/1/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/2/1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/2/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:512px\"><i style=\"left:511.5px;top:439.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:348.6px;top:462.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:369.9px;top:480.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:356.8px;top:455.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:439.3px;top:525.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:418.7px;top:469.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:541.1px;top:465.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:383.6px;top:412.2px\"></i><i style=\"